#~ "Run the **Open calendar in sidebar** "
#~ "command (or the ribbon/command palette) "
#~ "to open a sidebar view listing "
#~ "every event over the next 30 days,"
#~ " grouped by day, with "
#~ "\"Today\"/\"Tomorrow\" used in place of "
#~ "those two dates' headings. All-day "
